livekit signaller: an `allowed-subscribers` property for producers

A producer that sets it sends the server a SubscriptionPermission right after joining and
before it publishes: only the named identities may subscribe to its tracks (LiveKit still
lets recorder-granted participants through). Unset, nothing is sent and anyone may subscribe,
as before. WeaveSignal's desk sets it on each mix-minus publisher so a return reaches only the
person it is for (ADR-0118). WeaveSignal carries this patch; it is not offered upstream.

